                        "target_lang_word": "hankering",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hankering",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ccd6a27-34f6-3a40-814d-0bf5c2f9b9bd",
                                        "entry_id": "115495e4-86c5-3cae-a808-ae9c5576d89d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of hanker"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5056af3-98cb-4fa7-aaf4-56aa61d50b7f",
                                                "sense_id": "9ccd6a27-34f6-3a40-814d-0bf5c2f9b9bd",
                                                "text": "\"[…] You don't mean,\" Mr. Osborne continued, gathering wrath and astonishment as the thought now first came upon him; \"you don't mean that he's such a d—— fool as to be still hankering after that swindling old bankrupt's daughter? […]\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7385da98-6b4d-4d7e-bff1-2f82bb8001c2",
                                                "sense_id": "9ccd6a27-34f6-3a40-814d-0bf5c2f9b9bd",
                                                "text": "One may say that hankering after naughty things is the very essence of the evil into which we have been precipitated by Adam's fall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e69d9c4a-9db9-47d5-9342-25a23cfc027e",
                                                "sense_id": "9ccd6a27-34f6-3a40-814d-0bf5c2f9b9bd",
                                                "text": "[T]here is a clear sense that Britain is hankering for a change at the top."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "hankering",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "22339d51-6162-3fb8-98c2-af17624657fd",
                                        "entry_id": "293d20b5-558d-3f4a-a8d6-a4da7467cc20",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A strong, restless desire, longing, or mental inclination."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "often"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84a33646-03a0-4015-bb85-621b48a5a93d",
                                                "sense_id": "22339d51-6162-3fb8-98c2-af17624657fd",
                                                "text": "I found that he had dipped a little in chimerical studies and had a hankering after astrology and alchymy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "323c5b42-3b71-428b-bcab-0c9bd99d0670",
                                                "sense_id": "22339d51-6162-3fb8-98c2-af17624657fd",
                                                "text": "Mr. Hall thinks he has no personal hatred of Moore; he says he even likes to talk to him, and run after him, but he has a hankering that he should be made an example of."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "517e7461-ff34-41c2-8904-3af8a1c25c04",
                                                "sense_id": "22339d51-6162-3fb8-98c2-af17624657fd",
                                                "text": "But there was one yet - the biggest, the most blank, so to speak - that I had a hankering after."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aef02cfc-dd32-42ad-8049-0f4d85d4ed4a",
                                                "sense_id": "22339d51-6162-3fb8-98c2-af17624657fd",
                                                "text": "\"Some people are fond of a stay-at-home life, but I always had a hankering after adventures.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3fb6bfc-7671-40ea-854c-c464e09023ad",
                                                "sense_id": "22339d51-6162-3fb8-98c2-af17624657fd",
                                                "text": "“It looks wrong to me. But I have a hankering to work the thing out on my own. […]”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc06e629-0e49-444e-b552-bd5be4da09f8",
                                                "sense_id": "22339d51-6162-3fb8-98c2-af17624657fd",
                                                "text": "In other words, some species of human ancestor […] not only had a hankering for meat, which scientists had not expected, but used tools to get it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
